{"sha":"0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0ODA5NDU0Mjg6MGIzODAyOTgzMGY1OWQ4YTAwOTIxMzdjMzllYTRiMzBhYTEzNzdjYg==","commit":{"author":{"name":"danielscw","email":"neant76@gmail.com","date":"2020-03-29T07:40:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"danielscw","email":"neant76@gmail.com","date":"2020-03-29T07:43:32Z"},"message":"fix(microservices): fix get service from multi package grpc client error\n\nCalling getService of grpc clients with multiple packages shows error\n'Channel third argument (options) must be an object with string keys\nand integer or string values'. Which is caused by passing options with\nGrpcOptions['options'] format to grpc client's constructor.\nAs the options are transformed and kept in 'maxMessageLengthOptions' and\n'keepaliveOptions', we can remove and skip passing ClientGrpcProxy's\noptions to node grpc Client's constructor.","tree":{"sha":"2ad6f2ca8a3d6c2dec17f31c0f86898041a7eb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/git/trees/2ad6f2ca8a3d6c2dec17f31c0f86898041a7eb98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/git/commits/0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb","comment_count":1,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/commits/0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb","html_url":"https://github.com/nestjs/nest/commit/0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/commits/0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb/comments","author":{"login":"danielscw","id":6442957,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDI5NTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6442957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielscw","html_url":"https://github.com/danielscw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielscw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielscw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c